<title>UK: Eurobonds - Volumes of expected bond redemptions.</title>
<headline>Eurobonds - Volumes of expected bond redemptions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a summary of expected redemptions of international bonds in coming months.</p>
<p>The list was compiled from data supplied by Capital DATA Bondware. All figures are in millions of dollars (except USD and monthly totals). The total includes currencies not listed.</p>
<p>CURRENCY    Jan    Feb    Mar    Apr    May    Jun</p>
<p>USD (bln)   12.4   13.3   11.0   10.8    5.0    9.2</p>
<p>JPY	   3507   3070   2665   1546   2076   4877</p>
<p>DEM	   1865   3639   1032   2678   1458   1259</p>
<p>CAD	    492    680    484    679   1133    884</p>
<p>ECU	   1803   2900   1028   1451    641   1474</p>
<p>FRF	    631    180    423   2663    360    805</p>
<p>GBP	    576   1971   1834    960    891   1834</p>
<p>ITL	    110    813   1138    616    684   1111</p>
<p>SFR	   1722   1798   2075    990   1420   1954</p>
<p>AUD	    144    312   1002    477    348    490</p>
<p>ESP	    100    306    363    191    338	0</p>
<p>LUF	    208    135    111    239    181     65</p>
<p>NLG	    404    613    562    469    215    730</p>
<p>Total (bln) 24.4   30.4   24.5   24.3   14.9   25.0</p>
